<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108974" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποποιέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put under, assign to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διόνυσον τοῖς Ἑβραίων ἀπορρήτοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.671c
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>subject to oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>produce gradually,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύξαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῆλον καὶ συνήθειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Per.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>gain by underhand tricks, win by intrigue, win
			over,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς Λακεδαιμονίους</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.76
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1303b24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				5.452.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς χρήμασιν] ὑ. τινὰς ἐπί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Her.</u>
					10.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>assume, affect, put on,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τοῦ Κάτωνος παρρησίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Alex.</u>
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
